    "detailed_description": "This is a simple and fun cartoon style classic game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game, you can adjust the movement direction through the WASD button, and you need to control the character's movement.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nApple may appear in random places on the screen<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou need to manipulate the character to eat the apple (touch the apple) in order to earn points!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen your score is full, you will win!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are more realistic scenes here, creating a rich and colorful gaming world. Throughout the game, players can enjoy excellent background music while enjoying high-definition pixel style graphics. It has a clear sense of detachment from reality, with less clear patterns but rich symbolic meanings, giving players more room for imagination. Come and give it a try.",
    "about_the_game": "This is a simple and fun cartoon style classic game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game, you can adjust the movement direction through the WASD button, and you need to control the character's movement.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nApple may appear in random places on the screen<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou need to manipulate the character to eat the apple (touch the apple) in order to earn points!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen your score is full, you will win!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are more realistic scenes here, creating a rich and colorful gaming world. Throughout the game, players can enjoy excellent background music while enjoying high-definition pixel style graphics. It has a clear sense of detachment from reality, with less clear patterns but rich symbolic meanings, giving players more room for imagination. Come and give it a try.",
